019</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Goldfarb CA, Murtha YM, Gordon JE, Manske PR (2006) Soft-tissue distraction with a ring external fixation device before centralization for radial longitudinal deficiency. J Hand Surg [Am] 31(6):952&#x02013;959 </citation></ref><ref id="CR8"><label>8.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Gulati</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Joshi</surname><given-names>BB</given-names></name><name><surname>Milner</surname><given-names>SM</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Use of Joshi external stabilizing system in post burn contractures of the hand and wrist: a 20&#x000a0;year experience</article-title><source>J Burn Care Rehabil</source><year>2004</year><volume>25</volume><issue>5</issue><fpage>416</fpage><lpage>420</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1097/01.BCR.0000138297.68047.29</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Gulati S, Joshi BB, Milner SM (2004) Use of Joshi external stabilizing system in post burn contractures of the hand and wrist: a 20&#x000a0;year experience. J Burn Care Rehabil 25(5):416&#x02013;420 <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15353933</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR9"><label>9.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Patel</surname><given-names>MR</given-names></name><name><surname>Joshi</surname><given-names>BB</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Distraction method for chronic dorsal fracture dislocation of the proximal interphalangeal joint</article-title><source>Hand Clin</source><year>1994</year><volume>10</volume><issue>2</issue><fpage>327</fpage><lpage>337</lpage></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Patel MR, Joshi BB (1994) Distraction method for chronic dorsal fracture dislocation of the proximal interphalangeal joint. Hand Clin 10(2):327&#x02013;337 <pub-id pub-id-